 "notes": "Plaat van Oude Tonge, a boat dive in the Krammer north of Bruinisse: the mussel hang culture in 17-18 m where the dive is usually made, the boat position, the loop swum along the mussel lines and the shoal of the Plaat with its 10, 8 and 2.5 m lines and a 1 m patch. The mussel block sits between the K-A, K-E and K-F buoys that mark the mussel farm in OpenStreetMap; the shoal outline, shore, dam and buoys are from OpenStreetMap. The drowned remains of old Oude Tonge and the oyster-covered hills are described but not located, so they are not drawn.",
